WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
The general is chasing the Wolf Chef

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,600
One of the queues to participate in the Chaos Parade

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,080
Need to follow the rules of the game

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:08,080
After each draw of the knife, the knife will briefly enter the retraction period.

5
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,920
Wolf Chef cannot overcome obstacles

6
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,920
But it will sneak up on you from any angle as small as 120 degrees

7
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,640
when you are hung to death

8
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:22,790
Your body becomes its food and medicine goes away

9
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:24,070
Since we are looking for the key

10
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,990
Maybe there will be something like a motor

11
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:32,490
Chef Wolf is the regulator

12
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:33,610
we are survivors

13
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:35,010
stone pillars in church

14
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,330
It's probably the motor

15
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:37,810
Find the key to open the door

16
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:38,970
We can escape

17
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:41,750
If you encounter an obstacle along the way, just step over it.

18
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,270
Wolf Chef can't climb obstacles
